# 每分钟发送到期的 Webhook 投递；上一次未结束时不会重复启动；关机期间错过的不补做（下次触发会一并处理）
# Send due webhook deliveries every minute; runs never overlap; missed runs are not replayed (the next run covers them)
[Unit]
Description=Yonlink-CRM webhook delivery every minute

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*:*:00
AccuracySec=10s
Persistent=false

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
